{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A model builder is a more generic type of model. A model can be quite static,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thus, you have to be quite careful to have a model work with dynamic inputs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You cannot use reshape, or anything that can generate fixed tensor outputs from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a fixed inputs."}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ModelBuilder"}],"externalID":"s:3NNC12ModelBuilderC","symbolKind":"class","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ModelBuilder"}],"modules":[{"name":"NNC"}],"title":"ModelBuilder","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Class"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/nnc\/modelbuilder"]}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/AnyModelBuilder"],"title":"Inherits From"},{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/AnyModel"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ModelBuilder","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A model builder on the other hand doesn’t have that restriction. When input changes,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it simply calls the given builder closure to construct a new model. In such way,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you can continue to use reshape etc to assume fixed inputs and outputs, it will just"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"work for dynamic inputs. The newly built model will carry over stateful components"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(parameters) from the old models, thus, it doesn’t reset your training. This also means"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you need to make sure parameter shape won’t change when input changes, otherwise we"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will fatal."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/init(_:name:)-4pup0","doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/init(_:name:)-55gex"],"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/callAsFunction(_:inputs:_:streamContext:)-101bg","doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/callAsFunction(_:inputs:_:streamContext:)-4i10p","doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/callAsFunction(inputs:_:streamContext:)-4tnis","doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/callAsFunction(inputs:_:streamContext:)-8pae9","doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/compile(_:inputs:isEager:)-1lsvw","doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/compile(_:inputs:isEager:)-8ge5z","doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/compile(inputs:isEager:)-4kat6","doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder\/compile(inputs:isEager:)-4yweq"],"title":"Instance Methods"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.liuliu.s4nnc\/documentation\/NNC\/ModelBuilder","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://org.liuliu.s4nnc/documentation/NNC/ModelBuilder":{"titl